00:30:21.953 --> 00:30:23.922
Does it ever make you jealous

00:30:23.922 --> 00:30:26.357 align:start size:84% position:16%
that they have a
whole mainstream media

00:30:26.357 --> 00:30:28.560 align:start size:84% position:16%
to run cover for
them, that I would say

00:30:28.560 --> 00:30:31.362
