00:30:45.276 --> 00:30:46.845
brought on by the coronavirus.

00:30:46.845 --> 00:30:49.881
It wasn't caused by Vladimir
Putin's invasion of Ukraine.

00:30:49.881 --> 00:30:51.182
It was caused by the Democrats

00:30:51.182 --> 00:30:53.151
